  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Uracil is base present in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>RNA</mi></math>&nbsp; with the following structure. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> in uracil is _______.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0167_1733bf4b616e.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 269px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0167_1733bf4b616e.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 403px;\" /></p><p>The molecular formula of uracil is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>The molar mass of uracil&nbsp; = 112 g/mol</p><p>Mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>112</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math>&nbsp;= 25 %</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
